+      "Tailwind's default transition tier joins the ladder — a length binding with no curve slot (MOT-LADDER's node)",
+      ["curve"],
+    ],
+  ],
+  // ── THE FILL ARM (rule 9's two admissions). Both icons draw a stroke in from an INLINE
+  // `strokeDashoffset`, written by the template while `playing`. An animation's `forwards` fill
+  // outranks an inline author declaration; `none` does not. Drop the keyword and the mark
+  // snaps back to its inline offset the frame the animation ends — the stroke un-draws itself.
+  // So the arm is the SITE's here, not the verb's, and it is admitted rather than obeyed.
+  [
